      "writtenOn": "2013-05-01T19:09:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This represents a small fraction of the total cycles in the loop; timestamp_expired() and the deadline.val check (which is true only the first time through the loop) are equally large.\n\nBenchmark, THEN optimize.",
